<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CADisableMinimumFrameDurationOnPhone</key>
	<true/>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>$(DEVELOPMENT_LANGUAGE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>WIIN</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>wiinz_app</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(FLUTTER_BUILD_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleSignature</key>
	<string>????</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(FLUTTER_BUILD_NUMBER)</string>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UIApplicationSceneManifest</key>
	<dict>
		<key>UIApplicationSupportsMultipleScenes</key>
		<false/>
		<key>UISceneConfigurations</key>
		<dict>
			<key>UIWindowSceneSessionRoleApplication</key>
			<array>
				<dict>
					<key>UISceneClassName</key>
					<string>UIWindowScene</string>
					<key>UISceneConfigurationName</key>
					<string>flutter</string>
					<key>UISceneDelegateClassName</key>
					<string>$(PRODUCT_MODULE_NAME).SceneDelegate</string>
					<key>UISceneStoryboardFile</key>
					<string>Main</string>
				</dict>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>UIApplicationSupportsIndirectInputEvents</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UILaunchStoryboardName</key>
	<string>LaunchScreen</string>
	<key>UIMainStoryboardFile</key>
	<string>Main</string>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations~ipad</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortraitUpsideDown</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<!-- Purpose strings. Arabic first (the app is Arabic-first and the market is
	     Algeria), English appended so an App Store reviewer reads them without a
	     translator. See the localization note in HANDOFF-CURRENT.md if these ever
	     need to become per-language InfoPlist.strings files. -->
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>يستخدم WIIN الكاميرا لمسح رموز QR في نقاط الجمع لتسجيل قواريرك وكسب النقاط. — WIIN uses the camera to scan the QR code at a collection point when you deposit bottles.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>يستخدم WIIN موقعك لعرض أقرب نقاط الجمع على الخريطة وترتيبها حسب المسافة. — WIIN uses your location to show nearby collection points on the map and sort them by distance.</string>
	<!-- ⚠️ Required even though WIIN never requests "always" location. Apple's
	     ITMS-90683 check is on the APIs the BINARY REFERENCES, not the ones you
	     call: geolocator/permission_handler link the always-authorization API,
	     so the purpose string must exist or the upload is flagged. Worded to
	     match reality — the app only ever asks for while-in-use. -->
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>يستخدم WIIN موقعك أثناء استعمال التطبيق فقط، لعرض أقرب نقاط الجمع وترتيبها حسب المسافة. لا يتتبّع التطبيق موقعك في الخلفية. — WIIN uses your location only while you are using the app, to show nearby collection points and sort them by distance. It does not track your location in the background.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>يستخدم WIIN مكتبة الصور لاختيار صورة ملفك الشخصي. — WIIN uses your photo library so you can pick a profile picture.</string>

	<!-- The app ships no encryption of its own; it only talks HTTPS to the WIIN
	     API, which is exempt. Declaring it here means TestFlight never blocks a
	     build on the export-compliance question. -->
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>

	<!-- FCM: lets a push wake the app to handle a data payload. -->
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>remote-notification</string>
	</array>

	<!-- The App Store listing advertises these three languages. -->
	<key>CFBundleLocalizations</key>
	<array>
		<string>ar</string>
		<string>fr</string>
		<string>en</string>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
